      "name": "Team Gallery",
      "settings": {
        "title": "A REMOTE-FIRST TEAM WITH A SOCIAL SOUL.",
        "description": "<p>We're a distributed team with roots in Southern California—San Diego, to be exact—and we operate with that same balance of ambition and ease.</p><p>At Blue Tees, autonomy comes without isolation, collaboration without bureaucracy, creativity without ego, and big goals without burnout.</p><p>We move quickly, trust each other deeply, and build things we're genuinely proud of. Whether you're brainstorming a new feature, launching a product, or testing gear on the course, you'll feel the impact of your work every day.</p><p>And yes... we golf. A lot. We even have a full, in-house golf simulator.</p>",
